  "293": {
    "QuestID": 293,
    "Name": "A Quarter for a Quarter",
    "Desc": "I have an extra target to take care of. I got word of a bounty assigned to collect upgraded cybernetic chips of a pirate who underwent cyber augmentation. I don't know the identity of this pirate; however, if they went under augmentation, this may only bring trouble. \r\n\r\nLocate the target\u2019s hidden quarters, something odd is going on inside. Secure the target, make sure there are no stowaways around, trying to claim our bounty.\r\n\r\n",
    "EndText": "So Bone-Beard, Rhubarb\u2019s Rival, is the subject of the cybernetic augmentation? He escaped the matrix-cyber space into the \u201cport\u201d with his new body. If this is recent, this would explain his erratic behavior. We will have to terminate the target.",
