    "Name": "Cyber-Piracy",
    "Desc": "As informed in the briefing. Bone-Beard has gone through Cybernetic augmentation. This is a great bounty to claim @name ! This adventure will surely be worth the credits. Let\u2019s put an end to his Cyber-Piracy career.\r\n",
    "EndText": "Finally, we got the Cybernetically augmented C#hips. These can cause some real cyber-psychosis. He should have torrented his consciousness into back-up body, I would have set up a proper terminal to handle that and avoid cyber-psychosis. Why\u2026 are you looking at me like that\u2026?\r\n",
